# Project-scoped configuration for tooling. One copy for the whole project.
#
# YOU DO NOT NEED TO PUT ANYTHING HERE.
#
# The knowledge graph's LLM backend defaults to `claude-cli`, which drives the
# `claude` CLI already on your PATH. That means markdown extraction -- the step
# that turns ADRs, sessions and concepts into graph nodes -- runs with no API
# key at all, which is why this file can stay empty. Every agent on this project
# gets identical behaviour, and nothing depends on whose machine ran it.
#
# Do NOT export a personal API key in your own shell and do NOT commit one.
# Attribution of a change must never depend on whose account produced it.
#
# Only if you deliberately switch to a hosted backend do you need an entry here,
# and then it is the PROJECT's key, not yours. `.\scripts\update_knowledge_graph.ps1
# -Backend <name>` accepts: claude-cli (no key, default) | ollama (no key) |
# kimi | claude | openai | deepseek.
#
# MOONSHOT_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
